<title>JAPAN: Reuters average January Tapis assessed at $26.066.</title>
<headline>Reuters average January Tapis assessed at $26.066.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average Reuters price for Malaysian Tapis for January was $26.066 per barrel.</p>
<p>Malaysia's state-owned Petronas uses Reuters morning quotes in its monthly term crude formula.</p>
<p>Reuters prices:</p>
<p>    January 3 $26.55	 14 $27.15	 23 $25.45</p>
<p>		6 $26.95	 15 $26.45	 24 $25.45</p>
<p>		7 $26.95	 16 $26.45	 27 $24.55</p>
<p>		8 $27.30	 17 $26.55	 28 $24.40</p>
<p>		9 $27.40	 20 $25.98	 29 $24.40</p>
<p>	     10 $27.68	 21 $25.65	 30 $24.55</p>
<p>	     13 $27.10	 22 $25.55	 31 $24.88</p>
<p>--Tokyo Energy Desk (+81-3-5473-3708)</p>
